  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまの　みから　オイルを　だしててきから　みを　まもる。　オイルはとびあがるほど　にがくて　しぶい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리의 열매에서 오일을 나오게 해서 적으로부터 몸을 지킨다. 오일은 펄쩍 뛸 만큼 떫고 쓰다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會從頭上的果實噴出油來保護自己不受敵人攻擊。油的味道苦澀到會讓人跳起來。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le fruit qui surmonte sa tête sécrète une huile qui le protège de ses adversaires. Ce liquide a un goût si désagréable qu’il fait grimacer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Um sich vor Feinden zu schützen, sondert es aus der Frucht auf seinem Kopf Öl ab. Dieses ist so bitter, dass es einen zusammenzucken lässt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se defiende de sus rivales segregando por el fruto de su cabeza un aceite tan amargo y agrio que cualquiera daría un respingo al probarlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si protegge dai nemici secernendo un olio dal gusto incredibilmente amaro e allappante dal frutto che ha sulla testa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It protects itself from enemies by emitting oil from the fruit on its head. This oil is bitter and astringent enough to make someone flinch.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭の　実から　オイルを　出して敵から　身を　守る。　オイルはとびあがるほど　苦くて　渋い。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "从头上的果实喷出油，以此保护自己不受敌人攻击。那种油苦涩到能让人跳起来。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se defiende de sus rivales segregando por el fruto de su cabeza un aceite tan amargo y agrio que cualquiera daría un respingo al probarlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "えいようを　オイルにして　あたまのみに　たくわえる。　のまずくわずでも１しゅうかんは　へっちゃら。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "영양분을 오일로 바꿔서 머리의 열매에 비축한다. 아무것도 먹거나 마시지 않아도 일주일은 끄떡없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會把營養轉換成油，儲存在頭部的果實裡。１個星期不吃不喝也無所謂。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon convertit les nutriments en huile qu’il emmagasine dans le fruit qui surmonte sa tête. Il peut passer une semaine sans boire ni manger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Olini wandelt Nährstoffe in Öl um, welches es in der Frucht auf seinem Kopf speichert. Es kommt mühelos eine Woche ohne Essen und Trinken aus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Convierte los nutrientes de su dieta en aceite, que almacena en el fruto de la cabeza. Puede pasar una semana sin beber ni comer nada.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Trasforma in olio ciò di cui si nutre e lo conserva nel frutto sulla testa. Può facilmente resistere senza bere né mangiare per una settimana intera.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon converts nutrients into oil, which it stores in the fruit on its head. It can easily go a whole week without eating or drinking.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "栄養を　オイルにして　頭の実に　蓄える。　飲まず食わずでも１週間は　へっちゃら。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会把营养转换成油，并储存在头部的果实里。１个星期不吃不喝也无所谓。",
      "language": {
